---
import "./tl-styles.css";
---
<!-- Graduate Tracer -->
        <section class="ascii-tint-sec" id="tl-graduate-tracer">
          <div class="ascii-container">
            <div class="tl-bento" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
              <div class="ascii-white-card gold-accent tl-span-4 col-4">
                <div class="ascii-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">RESPONSE RATE • MAIN CAMPUS</div>
                <div
                  style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-maroon);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:6px;">
                  53.33%</div>
                <p style="font-size:0.86rem;color:#4B5563;margin:0;"><strong>220 out of 380 graduates</strong> responded
                  in the 2024 GTS (Batch 2022), surpassing the general campus average and demonstrating strong alumni
                  engagement.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ascii-white-card gold-accent tl-span-4 col-4">
                <div class="ascii-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">EMPLOYABILITY TIMELINE</div>
                <div
                  style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-maroon);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:6px;">
                  95.31% → 99%</div>
                <p style="font-size:0.86rem;color:#4B5563;margin:0;"><strong>95.31%</strong> of BSCS respondents were
                  employed or self-employed within 12 months of graduation, rising to <strong>99%</strong> within 24
                  months.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ascii-white-card gold-accent tl-span-4 col-4">
                <div class="ascii-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">DEGREE ALIGNMENT &amp; HTE</div>
                <div
                  style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-maroon);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:6px;">
                  86.39% / 13.1%</div>
                <p style="font-size:0.86rem;color:#4B5563;margin:0;"><strong>86.39%</strong> reported current jobs are
                  closely related to BSCS; <strong>13.1%</strong> of employed graduates were absorbed by their
                  <strong>Host Training Establishments (HTEs)</strong> (among the highest on campus).
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tl-bento">
              <div class="ascii-soft-card tl-span-6 col-6">
                <div class="ascii-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">GRADUATE IMPACT</div>
                <h3>Leaders, Influencers, Catalysts &amp; Trailblazers</h3>
                <p>BSCS alumni serve as team leaders, project managers, systems analysts, software engineers,
                  entrepreneurs, and digital transformation advocates across software development, IT consulting,
                  startups, academe, and government/private sectors—mentoring junior professionals and leading
                  technology-driven societal initiatives.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ascii-soft-card tl-span-6 col-6">
                <div class="ascii-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">EVIDENCE-BASED FEEDBACK LOOP</div>
                <h3>Integration with PEOs, SOs &amp; Curriculum Review</h3>
                <p>GTS findings are analyzed alongside Program Educational Objectives (PEOs), Student Outcomes (SOs),
                  and curriculum review discussions to inform curricular enhancements, experiential learning, industry
                  partnerships, and skills development.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>